Date: Sat, 24 Oct 2026 20:13:41 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 15/25] Meter: the plugins button turns the plugins' widgets
 off too

The puzzle button in the meter's header hid only the plugin window; a
plugin's widgets, such as the Map overlay, stayed over the game. Turned
off, the plugins now hide all their widgets as well, and they stay hidden
across a restart (widgets opened meanwhile start hidden) until the button
turns them on again, or the plugin window is shown some other way. Nothing
else brings them back meanwhile: not the game opening, not the meter
coming back to the front.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
